                                                "example_id": "a0370910-f87a-4219-b911-ec1fb204ddfa",
                                                "sense_id": "c6b62b28-162d-30fe-9329-6fe7b3ffeb1b",
                                                "text": "Two Dwarfs were at the bellows, another was holding a piece of red-hot metal on the anvil with a pair of tongs, a fourth was hammering it, and two, wiping their horny little hands on a greasy cloth, were coming forward to meet the visitors."
