                                                "example_id": "e07ff4af-f7ae-4f27-9563-d5df74f55a61",
                                                "sense_id": "1dd55819-4e16-311e-851a-46d87d80ac91",
                                                "text": "As I turn the corner, starin' in your cornea / You're gettin' hornier and hornier"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "741518e8-873b-4a77-8a25-3a6024d43a2b",
                                                "sense_id": "1dd55819-4e16-311e-851a-46d87d80ac91",
                                                "text": "It’s something of a cliché, at least among war correspondents, that war makes people unusually horny; what it actually does is make you want to touch as much flesh as you can get your hands on."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "99d85b11-81b9-4b96-8d33-ca1b3b509126",
                                                "sense_id": "1dd55819-4e16-311e-851a-46d87d80ac91",
                                                "text": "“Mrs. Fletcher,” the HBO mini-series about a middle-aged woman’s sexual reawakening, showcases a horny mom who can’t stop masturbating to pornography."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3edba7f1-d970-4195-a26e-dc6efca87657",
                                                "sense_id": "1dd55819-4e16-311e-851a-46d87d80ac91",
                                                "text": "“Sad gay men are objectively just the horniest people in the world,” Morrison says, citing a conversation with his therapist who assured him the combination of feelings is totally natural."
                                            }
